cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Liyab in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Liyab: on-device inference for large open language models"
abstract: >-
  A C++20 inference engine for GGUF language models on phones and laptops: models larger than RAM streamed from
  flash, thermal-aware pacing, context reuse and prefix caching for hybrid and mixture-of-experts models, and a
  private on-device assistant built on it.
authors:
  - given-names: Andrei
    family-names: Borcea
repository-code: "https://github.com/andrei-borcea/liyab"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - on-device AI
  - LLM inference
  - GGUF
  - mixture of experts
  - mobile
  - Android
  - iOS
  - privacy
